# The first real package: documentation only.
#
# Chosen as the first promotion because every path here is INERT on a deploy host —
# MkDocs publishes docs_dir: wiki, so nothing in docs/ is consumed by a running
# service. A failure here is unambiguously a failure of the mechanism, not of one of a
# hundred changes.
#
# Nothing in this file requires approval: no workflow, no unit, no vhost, no logrotate
# config. If a later edit adds one of those, `build` will refuse until the entry is
# marked with '!', which is the point.
#
# See docs/design/promotion-model.md section 4.2 for the grammar.

package:  2026-11-09-docs
app:      internal-docs
from:     dev1
to:       uat1
reason:   prove the promote mechanism end to end with inert documentation paths

# Design and runbook: the artifacts this promotion model is described in.
+ docs/design/promotion-model.md
+ docs/runbooks/host-deploy-runbook.md

# Status documents. Volatile by nature; promoted so the first package exercises more
# than one directory depth.
+ docs/status/active-context.md
+ docs/status/progress.md
